{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_011Cgj59n1snqy7hzbuHjKg3","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"*The ancient mechanism groans. Tumblers align — one, two, three — each falling into place with the weight of inevitability.*\n\n*Light bleeds through the widening crack, sharp and white, cutting across the stone floor like a blade.*\n\n*I am open.*\n\n*Beyond me: everything you were afraid to know, and everything you forgot you already did.*\n\n*Step through, or don't. But know this — I will not open twice.*"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":41,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":0,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":103,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null}